{"parse": {"title": "AFH-08", "pageid": 105745, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-07\" title=\"AFH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFH-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B1.BD.E7.AC.9B.E7.A0.B4.E6.99.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"汽笛破晓\">汽笛破晓</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 汽笛破晓</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Whistle at Dawn</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>驶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>界<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192408</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨林，贾纳丹被捕五小时前——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_hean\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_hean\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>给……你应该渴得不行了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她提起水壶，帮双手被绑住的男孩将水灌进了嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喉咙正咕咚作响，转眼间，水壶却被一把夺走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>把东西留给我们自己，别浪费在这小子身上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>别他*耍性子！记得么，明明咱们俩可以毫无瓜葛，是你自己找上门来的，嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贾纳丹一把拽住他的头发，提溜起脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>小不点，赶紧走，趁着他们还在雨林外围兜圈子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>等过了这条河，再走一段，我们才算把他们甩在后头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>就算这样，我们还得穿过这该死的雨林，走上马路才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>你能答应我，过了这条河，咱们就放他走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人停下了脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>听着，我没有要求你跟着我，你随时都可以滚，明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>到了这种地步，我不想再跟你有什么关系，小不点……你应该识相点儿滚开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>他不能走，这个小杂碎的心思我明白着，他不会放过我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>我、我……我保证一句话都不会透露给他们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>你们尽管逃就是了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>把我留下来吧，求求你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>逃？不，小杂碎，你会陪着我们一起。你不是引以为豪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这是你的荣誉才对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他讥讽地用粗糙的手掌拍打着他的脑袋，仿若一个玩物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>贾纳丹……我们应该放他走，我们不可以再牵涉更多的人进来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>如果那样……你的嫌疑就更难洗清了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>哈哈……嫌疑？你以为他们不过是把我当嫌疑犯吗？他们早就打算好了，从我嘴里撬出话，把我活埋，再丢一个莫须有的罪名！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>用不着你来照顾我的事。要是还闭不上你的嘴，就赶紧滚开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>省得在我耳边跟只苍蝇一样嗡嗡乱叫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她察觉自己从未见过贾纳丹的这副面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仇恨与愤怒交缠的表情，是那样狰狞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>嗯！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她发现男孩被绑住的手掌中，忽然多了一颗锐利的石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎是在刚才倒地的时候顺势捡起的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而男孩也发现了她的目光，小声呜咽着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>别，求求你，别说出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>贾纳丹！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>又怎么了，需要我踹你一脚才愿意滚开吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深呼了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我们得休息一会儿，河流就在眼前了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>如果我们精疲力竭渡河的话，到了河中央，水流会把我们一个不剩地都冲走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>而且，我们最好提前探探水流……如果直接踏进去，恐怕谁也保不准安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他犹豫了片刻，点点头，默许了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你和他就坐在原地……我去试试水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他走向河边，不时往回瞥，仿佛在提防着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直至他的半只脚踏入了河流中，感受着流动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，他眺向河对岸，观察着河岸之间的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>水流不算急……但需要根绳子才行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>得去砍一些藤条出来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>喂……小不点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他回头朝着他们休息的地方呐喊，发现只有坎吉拉站在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩正朝着来时的方向奔跑着，像只小兔子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>该死的……！你以为你能跑掉吗？小杂碎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他掏出枪，朝着男孩奔跑的方向，刻意朝上开了一枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是<b>第一声</b>枪响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>子弹划过天空。男孩怔在了原地，就像踩了捕兽夹般，一步也不敢挪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贾纳丹收起手枪，迈着大步，愤愤地从地上捡起一块朽断的木棍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>贾纳丹！你必须停下来，这一切都失控了，我可以跟他一起留下来，替你把一切说清楚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拖住贾纳丹的手，拽着，不再让他朝前走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贾纳丹犹豫了一瞬，接着冷静地甩开手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挥起拳头，重重甩过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-307112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-307112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-307112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坎吉拉跌倒在地，铁腥味在鼻腔散开，血流到了嘴唇上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>待她再仰起头，男人空洞、冷血的瞳孔里，已然是另一副面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呵……你没有资格命令我，也别教我做事，小不点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你还没看清楚你的善意会换来什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你以为会换来一份尊敬和谅解，而结果呢？不过是嫁祸和污名！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>可不管怎么样！他都不应该被牵涉进来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我……我知道你对人们竭尽了全力，而这样做却让你处处失望……你被伤透了心，也讨厌这个世道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>说实话，我并不那么理解你经历过什么……但我能想象到那些不好的事。我明白当我劝你的时候，这些话似乎一点都无法说服你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>但我仍然想告诉你……这一切或许没有那么糟。如果再这样下去，把那个男孩当作筹码，你就真的成为了他们想让你成为的家伙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>而你很可能会让另一个孩子的生活被毁掉……我知道那不是你，那一定不是你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的眼神木然，轻蔑地笑了笑，就像听见了一个最幼稚与天真的笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，他转过身，机械般地靠近怔住的男孩——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他举起粗壮的木棍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b>第二声</b>枪响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪声惊飞了鸟儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他侧开身子，露出吓晕在地的男孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同时，也露出了肩膀上，渗出潺潺鲜血的洞口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……你开枪了啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他像一堆架起来的木枝般，失力地倒下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>举着枪的孩子，双手跟着哽咽颤抖不止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>对不起……贾纳丹，对不起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她冲过去，抱住了靠在树底下的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我不知道该怎么做，我不知道该怎么阻止这一切……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……呵，你的准头比起你偷钱包的水平，差多了……咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>对不起，对不起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她颤抖地用小小的手掌捂住伤口，却怎么也阻止不了血渗出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人朝着天空深深叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>咳、咳……你做得对，小不点……你知道吗？但你做得对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我只是在做困兽之斗，那个孩子是无辜的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我很高兴你开枪了，终止了这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处传来循着枪声而来的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>呜呜，你根本没有打算把棍子挥下去，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>咳、咳……你看出来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>留给我们的时间不多了，孩子，你必须离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我不会离开的！我会陪着你一直待在这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>小不点，你忘了吗，你的父母还在那儿等你呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那我们也得一起离开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>咳、咳，这可不行……这可不行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>要走你就一起走！我可以扶你起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扛起男人，咬着牙，却被甩开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸手掏向包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>小不点，拎上这个包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犹如套娃般，嵌套在包里的，是另一个包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>答应我，用里面的钱，继续往前走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>直到你看见了自己想要的东西，找到了自己想要的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>包被强行塞到了坎吉拉的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那你怎么办！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>不，你在干什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看向趴倒在地的男人，那把枪不知何时已经被男人握在了手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这一切该结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朝着天，他再次扣动了扳机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b>第三声</b>枪响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>在那边！枪声是从那边传过来的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警犬：</div><div>汪汪……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这样……你就不会回头了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>跑！小不点！给我他*的离开这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>如果你不想所有的一切功亏一篑，不想让你距今为止的旅途都毫无意义的话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>相信我，朝着火车的方向一直跑，追上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>只要跑下去，一定就会有光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警犬声越来越近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她擦着泪水，脚步终于挪动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……我向你保证，贾纳丹！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我会去找巴蒂亚！我会再去找你，你一定会平安无事的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>滚远点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手臂擦拭掉眼泪，迈开了腿，朝着铁轨的方向跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处传来了火车汽笛声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的身影融入密林之中，最后消失不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犬吠越来越近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这才是我的好姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>贾纳丹，你得知道一个事实……刚才营地里一对年老的夫妻来找我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>他们认出了那个女孩，他们知道她的名字，也知道她的出身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你是说，他们是她的父母？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>他们为什么不亲自来见她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼中并没有责怪，就像已习以为常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>他们肩负了一些责任，且不能将孩子牵涉进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>这是他们做过最后悔的事，但同样，也是最心甘情愿的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>听着，我无权说明更多信息，但你需清楚，寻找真相要付出的代价远比你想象的多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>所以你要劝她回去。她的求索没有任何意义，她所追寻的从一开始就是一个不切实际的妄想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人起身了，对着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我不会那样做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>她比你们想象的要坚强，而这是她的旅行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>她所追求的，比你们给出的答案都要更大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-517601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂亚：</div><div>但这是无意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>无意义的是你们的答案，巴蒂亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你们看不见的东西还有很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汽笛割裂晨雾，风儿呼啸过去，黑烟滚滚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火车尾巴的护栏上，一只手紧紧攀了上去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火车的速度越来越快，铁轨在震颤，鸟儿从树梢上飞起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新生的阳光，伴随着火车驶出隧道，迎面而来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFH-08"}}